    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bright and contemporary, the two-bedroom apartment includes open-plan living with modern furnishings and generous wardrobes in both bedrooms. Features a main bathroom and en-suite, both with rainfall showers. The living area is fitted with a luxurious sofa, dining space, and a modern kitchen with Neff appliances.\r\n\r\nFor more information or to Book a Viewing, please visit https://glassbottle.ie/"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Residents lounges - Shared space to unwind and connect with neighbours.\r\nGym and fitness studio - A fully-equipped fitness area for a life of balance and wellbeing.\r\nCo-working spaces - Flexible co-working space for the perfect work/life balance.\r\nSky lounge and private dining - A bookable space for your special events\r\nRooftop terrace - With beautiful views and dedicated space for BBQs.\r\nPrivate screening room - A residents-only screening room for movie nights.\r\nMeetings rooms - Bookable meeting rooms for focused work and collaboration.\r\nExercise terrace - A terrace to bring your workout into the fresh sea air.\r\nPet friendly - Where you and your pets both feel at home.\r\nLandscaped courtyards - Outdoor seating on the edge of the coastline.\r\nOnsite management - Professional onsite team available.\r\nDublin Bay on your doorstep - Coastal living brings a life of balance, mindfulness and wellbeing.\r\nSecure bike storage - Lock away your bikes in your shared storage facility"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Located on the Sean Moore Road, Sandymount, Dublin 4"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewings are available Monday - Sunday\r\nBook a time online at https://glassbottle.ie/"
      }
